WEBVTT

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:21.980
<i>The shining horizon</i>

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:28.440
<i>Where beginning and end meld together</i>

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:33.490
<i>That's where tears come from</i>

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.240
<i>With a trembling hand,</i>

00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:40.870
<i>I stuffed my pocket full</i>

00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:40.870
<i>of the things I believed in</i>

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:48.170
<i>A mirage wavering in the distance</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:55.430
<i>Looking up at the sky, like a guiding beacon</i>

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:59.640
<i>A familiar, warm light</i>

00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:05.980
<i>Granting me that, you give a little wave</i>

00:01:06.190 --> 00:01:10.110
<i>I have to go, I won't cry anymore, Shangri-La</i>

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:13.990
<i>I'll dive into a new world</i>

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:21.080
<i>In the embrace of this color blue</i>

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:28.880
<i>With this thrilling in my heart for company</i>

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:30.260
"Iwato Trapar Industry"

00:12:16.190 --> 00:12:18.400
"Free Scubs" "No Plants!" "Free Scubs"

00:22:42.570 --> 00:22:49.530
<i>Riding the beckoning wind</i>

00:22:49.740 --> 00:22:56.660
<i>Bound for the unknown darkness</i>

00:22:56.870 --> 00:23:04.000
<i>There, in that place that I'll never return to</i>

00:23:04.210 --> 00:23:10.930
<i>I find you</i>

00:23:11.140 --> 00:23:14.430
<i>I say, "hello"</i>

00:23:14.640 --> 00:23:18.100
<i>The foreboding that starts racing</i>

00:23:18.310 --> 00:23:25.400
<i>I imagine freeing it fast and up high</i>

00:23:25.610 --> 00:23:28.860
<i>Hello, my soul</i>

00:23:29.070 --> 00:23:33.530
<i>Like smashing it to pieces</i>

00:23:58.850 --> 00:24:02.690
"Preview"
